    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but the doctor's office is like 40 mins away and i really cant afford to miss the whole afternoon. its just a small hole, not like a huge cut or anything. i have some hydrogen peroxide and some superglue in the house, would it be okay if i just cleaned it with the peroxide and then glued it shut to keep the dirt out? seems easier than driving all the way there for something minor.",
